"""AlienFX LEDs — lighting control for Alienware and Dell machines (GTK 4 / libadwaita).

D-Bus client of alienfixd (system bus; ALIENFIX_BUS=session targets
tests/mock_daemon.py). Every D-Bus call is asynchronous: the UI never blocks,
even when the chassis controller takes ~2 s. The daemon is the source of
truth; the UI redraws on StateChanged and rebuilds on LayoutChanged.

The pages follow the machine's model (served by the daemon): a per-key
keyboard is drawn from the chassis template of the active profile (real key
geometry in key units); a zone keyboard and the chassis lights are listed as
zones.

Usage: alienfx-leds [--page keyboard|effects|chassis|ripple|profile]
"""

